<opsproc code="00027973.0001001" revdate="2024-05-22T17:38:16"><title>Braking/Steering Control Unit (BSCU) System 1(2)</title><procdesc code="00027973.0001001.029" lid="N.00027973.0001001.055"><para code="00027973.0001001.030" layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.056">The automatic braking of the
wheels during landing gear retraction may be inoperative. </para></procdesc><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.035"><title>After takeoff</title><procbody lid="N.00027973.0001001.036"><limit layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.037"><lit-limit lid="N.00027973.0001001.038">Keep the landing gear down for <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="min">1</measure> to allow the wheels to spin down.</lit-limit></limit><condition at-any-time="false" code="00027973.0001001.017" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.039" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of engine failure at takeoff:</intro><procbody lid="N.00027973.0001001.040"><action layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.041" memory="false"><command code="00027973.0001001.018"><para layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.042">Retract the landing
gear when positive climb.</para></command><comment code="00027973.0001001.019"><para layer="1" lid="N.00027973.0001001.043">Vibrations may occur
during <measure category="Time" show-unit="false" system="SI and derived" unit="min">1</measure> or <measure category="Time" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="min">2</measure> after the retraction of the landing gear.</para></comment></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>